    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970424.0574\n\nBEIJING, April 24 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENTFirst Taiwanese freighter docks in mainland port\n\n\n\n\nA Taiwanese frighter docked in the southwestern Chinese port of Xiamen on Friday, the first to make the direct journey across the Taiwan Straits in nearly five decades, port authorities said.",
